    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9906fae11a51dd12726a8bf2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "菊花赏结束后・贯穿，在最前线",
      "source_fingerprint": "c87fd3dffd4e410ca596e707b19a84a92f02d1ef4a5efeb696d5dc49b5ec5f7c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c18c96ae0f0732af2c98b6aa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "千明代表称霸了“菊花赏”。\n“最强的是千明代表”\n这个世间的常识还是没有被推翻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "de98cacc75a5e99a82ec43bef58fecd79ff8e6df522eedf0f3bbd52c4d93044f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35532245a32c0d4095dc2400",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "尽管如此，葛城王牌的英姿，\n还是为她的朋友以及椎名弗雷瑞斯带来了希望。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe6081945d767f519291d3d2ef35db0e213aa294594b81820a2f40a471947d2c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e8e7241157ff56eea03c813",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "葛城王牌想累积让世人\n无不认可自己就是顶点的成就。\n因此两人决定以“中距离最强”为目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc16473160ce9cc20b70a275452fa995cb86b592457cf686ba1024594cae016b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb290f5480b862070b6349b4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是在那之后……\n传来了千明代表要休养的消息。\n葛城王牌为此感到失望。",
      "source_fingerprint": "20e0e1867bc775ca4f89db49bbea374dd76e9a3173e3c44375ac482db4da9820",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aee8fb0109f75dfd52bc2baa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过，现在竞争对手缺席了，\n葛城王牌决定趁机展现自己的存在感。\n以“大阪杯”为目标，迈出了步伐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d39c7e05e5aaf44f964fcbecb72c963de50f85e8bf80857d0292276ab10c8524",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04b940f36ae11abc2e0a9df5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "菊花赏结束后・展现，在最前线",
      "source_fingerprint": "914ad6953827871bc03c6564cf060b1fb2c3bea6de7660dcdee6252f19ae181c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0b041321a990350a6daefc1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "葛城王牌在“菊花赏”败北了。\n并且，其他参赛者还是没能推翻\n被当作千明代表附属品的世间“常识”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fa9b8f26316528e0807e046e0698e27b3153a8dcdcf68b4f5f108e9686d0269",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1104/storytimeline_501104429.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85fe37d744d579abfd95f8e8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "尽管如此，葛城王牌的英姿，\n还是为她的朋友以及椎名弗雷瑞斯带来了希望。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe6081945d767f519291d3d2ef35db0e213aa294594b81820a2f40a471947d2c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
